{"4274210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Medieval Decklords", "steam_appid": 4274210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Medieval Decklords is a  roguelike card game which focus on 3-card poker gameplay.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274210/extras/750879b19c7c0a51a1a2e7be698b229a.poster.avif?t=1787937900\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274210/extras/750879b19c7c0a51a1a2e7be698b229a.webm?t=1787937900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274210/extras/750879b19c7c0a51a1a2e7be698b229a.mp4?t=1787937900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Core Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three-Lane Board</strong>: Matches take place across the Left Flank, Center, and Right Flank. Each lane is evaluated independently to determine a winner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poker-Based Scoring</strong>: Players play exactly three cards per lane to form hands. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Management</strong>: The deck consists of 40 cards featuring standard suits and numbers 1–10. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Match Constraints</strong>: Each match consists of four turns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274210/extras/dcf50c0ea4d191442251100edff03f5f.poster.avif?t=1787937900\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274210/extras/dcf50c0ea4d191442251100edff03f5f.webm?t=1787937900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274210/extras/dcf50c0ea4d191442251100edff03f5f.mp4?t=1787937900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Progression and Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currency and Upgrades</strong>: Players earn silver coins based on match results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Improvement</strong>: Spend 5 silver coins to upgrade any of the 40 cards in your deck once per season. Upgrades reset each season, though top-ranked players may retain a limited number of improvements for future sessions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274210/extras/59d54b4450a002547301e355ed4057f3.poster.avif?t=1787937900\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274210/extras/59d54b4450a002547301e355ed4057f3.webm?t=1787937900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274210/extras/59d54b4450a002547301e355ed4057f3.mp4?t=1787937900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Medieval Decklords is a  roguelike card game which focus on 